      "summaries": {
        "en": "Craft Agents OSS is an open-source framework for building autonomous AI agents that can execute complex workflows by breaking them down into manageable tasks. Its technical innovation lies in using a modular architecture where specialized agents handle specific functions, enabling flexible composition of capabilities. Developers can implement it by defining agent roles and communication protocols in TypeScript, then deploy these agents to automate processes like data analysis or content generation pipelines.",
        "zh": "Craft Agents OSS 是一个开源框架，用于构建能够执行复杂工作流程的自主AI智能体。它通过模块化架构实现技术突破，让不同专业功能的智能体协同工作，将大任务分解为可管理的小步骤。开发者可以用TypeScript定义智能体角色和通信协议，灵活组合各种能力模块，从而创建自动化数据处理、内容生成或系统监控等实际应用。这种设计让AI代理更易控制和扩展，适合需要多步骤决策的实际场景。",
        "es": "Craft Agents OSS is an open-source framework for building autonomous AI agents that can execute complex workflows by breaking them down into manageable tasks. Its technical innovation lies in using a modular architecture where specialized agents handle specific functions, enabling flexible composition of capabilities. Developers can implement it by defining agent roles and communication protocols in TypeScript, then deploy these agents to automate processes like data analysis or content generation pipelines.",
        "sections": {
