      "summaries": {
        "en": "MobileBERT-uncased is a compact BERT variant optimized for mobile and edge devices, addressing the challenge of deploying powerful language models in resource-constrained environments. It achieves efficiency through bottleneck structures and progressive knowledge transfer, maintaining strong performance while significantly reducing parameters. Developers can fine-tune it for tasks like text classification or question answering using Hugging Face's Transformers library, enabling on-device NLP applications without cloud dependency.",
        "zh": "MobileBERT-uncased 是专为移动和边缘设备优化的轻量级 BERT 变体，解决了在资源受限环境中部署强大语言模型的难题。它通过瓶颈结构和渐进式知识蒸馏技术，在显著减少参数量的同时保持了较强的语义理解能力。开发者可利用 Hugging Face 的 Transformers 库对其进行微调，适用于文本分类、问答等任务，实现无需云端依赖的本地化自然语言处理应用，为移动端 AI 功能开发提供实用解决方案。",
        "es": "MobileBERT-uncased is a compact BERT variant optimized for mobile and edge devices, addressing the challenge of deploying powerful language models in resource-constrained environments. It achieves efficiency through bottleneck structures and progressive knowledge transfer, maintaining strong performance while significantly reducing parameters. Developers can fine-tune it for tasks like text classification or question answering using Hugging Face's Transformers library, enabling on-device NLP applications without cloud dependency.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "mobilebert-uncased stands out for transformers, pytorch, and tf in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "MobileBERT-uncased is a compact BERT variant optimized for mobile and edge devices, addressing the challenge of deploying powerful language models in resource-constrained environments. It achieves efficiency through bottleneck structures and progressive knowledge transfer, maintaining strong performance while significantly reducing parameters. Developers can fine-tune it for tasks like text classification or question answering using Hugging Face's Transformers library, enabling on-device NLP applications without cloud dependency.",
